+Commit message kehta hai: “Add status constants, time types, unique ID, input validation, hold-confirm-release flow, and documentation”. Par asli code mein ye cheezein nahi hain.
+
+Hua ye ki us commit mein files galat naam se save hui: Updated \internals/domain.go, Updated `README.md, Updated `.gitignorejaise literal filenames bane, jisme backtick bhi hai. Ye lagta hai aider jaisa AI tool ka output hai jo seedhe file ki jagah naam mein "Updated” laga ke likh gaya. Agle commit 51672d8 ne internals/ wali 3 galat files delete kar di, aur unke andar jo features the (status constants, time.Time, ID generation, 5 min expiry) wo bhi real files tak kabhi pahunche hi nahi. Real domain.go aur memory_store.go bilkul waise hi hain jaise pehle the.
+
+Ek aur baat: us galat memory_store.go mein ID generator sirf return "unique-id" karta tha, yani har booking ki same ID. Wo kaam bhi sahi nahi tha.
+
+Abhi repo mein bacha kachra (delete karna chahiye)
+Updated \.gitignore, Updated `README.md, go test -raceye 3 files root par hain aur inka koi kaam nahi.go test -race` file mein sirf ek line likhi hai (“This will help ensure...”), jo asal mein README ka tukda hai.
+Asli README.md aur .gitignore abhi bhi adhure hain. Achhi .gitignore wali content Updated \.gitignoremein padi hai, usko asli.gitignore` mein daalna hai.
+Aage ka plan
+
+Ye order sabse aasan rahega:
+
+Kachra files delete karo, README aur .gitignore ka content sahi jagah daalo.
+domain.go mein status constants aur ExpiresAt time.Time ka change karo.
+Book() mein real unique ID aur expiry set karo (uuid ya crypto/rand).
+Hold, confirm, release logic likho, aur uske tests.
+Handler mein validation aur handler tests.

